    {
      "id": "obs_3",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "Sure. The process starts when the sales employee receives the customer's quotation request. That's the trigger. As for the intended outcome, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_12",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "After that, I check the customer information in the CRM."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_14",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "Yes, I'm the sales employee. I check the customer information in the CRM."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_23",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "Next, I create the quotation in the quoting system using the customer information and the pricing information."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_33",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "After I create the quotation, if the amount is over 1,000,000 yen, the manager approves the high-value quotation; if it is at or below 1,000,000 yen, I send the quotation to the customer; and if it is month-end, I send the month-end summary to Accounting."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_51",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "I don't know whether the month-end summary is sent in addition to the amount-based path or instead of it. What I do know is that after I create the quotation, if the amount is over 1,000,000 yen the manager approves it, if it's at or below 1,000,000 yen I send the quotation to the customer, and if it's month-end I send the month-end summary to Accounting."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_53",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "After that, I send the quotation to the customer by email."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_60",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "Yes, after the manager approves the high-value quotation, I send the quotation to the customer by email. And yes, it's the same step as the low-value path — whether the amount is over 1,000,000 yen and the manager approves, or it's at or below 1,000,000 yen, the send step is the same. After that, I don't know of anything else happening."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_62",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "The manager's approval is needed for high-value quotations for credit risk management."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_67",
      "speaker": "stakeholder",
      "text": "I don't know why creating the quotation is necessary."
    },
    {
      "id": "obs_71",
